# Raspberry Pi kernel & boot firmware, trixie era:
#  - raspberrypi-bootloader / raspberrypi-kernel are gone; replaced by
#    raspi-firmware + the linux-image-rpi-* meta-packages.
#  - linux-image-rpi-v8: kernels for Pi 3/4/CM4 and earlier (aarch64)
#
# linux-image-rpi-2712 (Pi 5 / CM5) is deliberately NOT installed. WaziGate
# targets Pi 3/4/CM4, and a second kernel costs a full module tree plus its own
# depmod and update-initramfs run -- all under qemu emulation, which is what
# pushed the build from ~22 min to ~1h43. To support Pi 5 / CM5, re-add it here
# and see stage1/00-boot-files/files/config.txt.
raspi-firmware
linux-image-rpi-v8
